From 24822083268c5834390d5985df94cc678c046b2f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mohamed Ashry <contact@atharapp.download>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 06:35:59 +0400
Subject: [PATCH 1/7] feat(ui): add DS v2 token families, R6 v2 rules and the
 app length ratchet

Colours gain scrim + four contrast-proven tints; new lines.ts (8 border
shorthands) and elevation.ts (plate/lift + 8 layers) follow the both-theme
cascade rule; spacing gains the 0.5/1.5/2.5 half-steps; sizes gain the
23-token layout family; typography gains the single code tracking token;
breakpoints.ts is TS-only and CSS-parity-exempt. internal.ts borders and
the Composer/ModelPicker layer/weight literals now name tokens at identical
computed values. R6.7/R6.8 close the unitless-literal and :root-selector
loopholes; R6.9/R6.10 hold the apps to APP_LENGTH_BUDGET=145, measured at
base 0772d50, tighten-only via WARSHA_R6_APP_LENGTH_BUDGET. ModelPicker's
keydown moves from document to the component, focus returns to the trigger
on close, and autoLabel/autoDescription arrive as optional English-default
props. Every new rule ships planted and clean fixtures.
